msgid "serialise it as CBOR, and sign those bytes. For ES256 the COSE signature value is the fixed-width concatenation {code0}, 32 bytes each — not the ASN.1 DER encoding that most crypto libraries return by default. Converting between the two is the single most common interoperability bug in HCERT implementations."
